==== Modification Notice (Frontend/Backend Separation Fork) ====

This repository is a modified version of the new-api web console. The
modifications consist of extracting the frontend from the backend repository
into a standalone project and making it independently buildable and
deployable:

  - The React frontend source has been moved out of the new-api backend
    repository into this standalone project.
  - The backend address is centralized in a single module
    (src/lib/api-base.ts), with apiUrl, absoluteApiUrl and apiOrigin helpers
    built on top of it, instead of being scattered across the codebase.
  - A build-time variable VITE_API_BASE_URL was introduced so the console can
    target a backend that is deployed on a different origin. An empty value
    means same-origin.
  - The session hint returned by the backend (new_api_has_session) is mirrored
    into localStorage so a separated deployment can still detect an existing
    login session across origins.
  - The build output is a standalone static bundle served by Nginx with an SPA
    fallback, deployable independently of the backend.

